# 这两个文件的 SHA-256 摘要被编译进产品代码（CanonicalMesTaskUnionQuery /
# CanonicalSublotBoxCountQuery 的 ExpectedSha256），摘要是按原始字节算的。
# 少了这两条规则，git 会按平台改行尾，摘要立刻对不上、构建出来的包被判为
# 未批准。规则从拆分前 8005---AGV 的根 .gitattributes 原样继承。
queries/mes-task-union/query.sql text eol=crlf
queries/sublot-box-count/query.sql -text -diff

# The agent instruction pair is pinned together, so both files have the same
# bytes on every checkout, Windows clones included. CLAUDE.md imports AGENTS.md
# on its first line; .github/scripts/Test-AgentInstructions.ps1 checks both rules
# (program#230).
AGENTS.md text eol=lf
CLAUDE.md text eol=lf
